# Three inputs, the middle one refused by a slot's `capacity`: `abcd` is four
# codepoints against three, refused with BoundsError(CAP_VALUE_CAPACITY, 3, 4)
# after its FactAssert is recorded ([RFCS.6.7]). The inputs either side show
# it changed nothing.
assert Line k=1 text=abc
pump
assert Line k=2 text=abcd
pump
assert Line k=3 text=ab
pump
